[3] head to head, at matched cost
      voxel Foldy-Lax  (136 cells, 1224 unknowns): err 0.1073 in 0.19 s
      impedance march  (N=81, 243 unknowns)      : err 0.0112 in 0.98 s
      ratio of errors at comparable cost: 9.6x
